<title>BRAZIL: Opening prices for June 4 Brazil coffee auction.</title>
<headline>Opening prices for June 4 Brazil coffee auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Opening prices for the 150,000 60-kg bags of coffee stocks to be auctioned by the Brazilian government at 1400 local/1700 GMT on June 4 are as follows, according to Banco do Brasil which is holding the sale.</p>
<p>Quantity is given in bags, price in Brazilian reais per bag.</p>
<p>    QTY	CROP	COLOR	LOCATION			PRICE</p>
<p>   16,000   1981/82   Yellowish   Campos Altos, MG	     163</p>
<p>    7,000   1986/87   Yellowish   Conceicao do Rio Verde, SP 161</p>
<p>    7,000   1987/88   Yellowish   Juiz de Fora, MG	     161</p>
<p>    7,550   1986/87   Yellowish   Arapongas, PR		  153</p>
<p>    3,920   1986/87   Yellowish   Arapongas, PR		  161</p>
<p>   11,120   1987/88   Yellowish   Arapongas, PR		  153</p>
<p>    1,550   1987/88   Light green Arapongas, PR		  156</p>
<p>    1,570   1981/82   Yellowish   Arapongas, PR		  151</p>
<p>	960   1981/82   Yellowish   Arapongas, PR		  154</p>
<p>   12,530   1986/87   Yellowish   Arapongas, PR		  156</p>
<p>   20,800   1981/82   Yellowish   Jandaia do Sul, PR	   157</p>
<p>   10,000   1983/84   Yellowish   Paranavai, PR		  152</p>
<p>    9,321   1987/88   Yellowish   Lins, SP			 156</p>
<p>	403   1987/88   Yellowish   Lucelia, SP		    156</p>
<p>    9,191   1986/87   Yellowish   Lucelia, SP		    161</p>
<p>   31,085   1987/88   Yellowish   Araraquara, SP		 156</p>
<p>TOTAL - 150,000 bags</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
